{"obsah":"<p>On Mother's Day we organised a Mix camp for everyone interested in technique. The weather worked out, so a group of male and female bikers could take on both our coaching and everything we put in their way. This time Katarína Tóthová and Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček chose easier locations that could suit all riders. We managed to cover the basics as well as a few more advanced techniques. We were a little surprised by our afternoon return to the Tehov leisure park, which was packed – finding a free spot on the pump track was really hard.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>For Vlasta it was also his first camp on the CUBE e-bike he was issued, and since one of the participants was riding electric too, it came in handy as a demonstration of everything you can do on an e-bike.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F05%2F20250511_172819.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F05%2F20250511_172819.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250801\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F05%2F20250511_1646440.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F05%2F20250511_1646440.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250800\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F05%2F20250511_1646360.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-conte